#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:5
msgid "Sandbox and credentials"
msgstr "沙箱与凭据"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:7
msgid ""
"When a node answers a task from a peer that its operator does not trust, "
"it can run the local agent inside a sandbox. This page describes what the"
" sandbox restricts, how the node gives the agent access to a model "
"without giving it a key, how the operator allows access to selected "
"hosts, and how the number of runs is limited."
msgstr ""
"节点在回答其运营人员不信任的对端发来的任务时，可以在沙箱内运行本地 Agent。本页说明沙箱限制什么、节点如何在不交出密钥的情况下让 Agent "
"访问模型、运营人员如何允许访问选定的主机，以及如何限制运行次数。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:18
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:20
msgid ""
"The text of a task is written by the requester. If the provider passes it"
" to a coding agent, the requester influences a program that can read "
"files, run commands and use the network, and that holds the credentials "
"of the model service. A sandbox limits what such a program can do "
"whatever the text says."
msgstr ""
"任务的文本由请求方撰写。如果提供方将其交给编码 "
"Agent，请求方就影响了一个可以读取文件、运行命令、使用网络并持有模型服务凭据的程序。无论文本写了什么，沙箱都会限制这类程序能做的事情。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:25
msgid ""
"The sandbox applies to the ``exec`` backend of auto-reply (see "
":doc:`delegation`) and is selected for a turn in three cases:"
msgstr "沙箱适用于自动回复的 ``exec`` 后端（参见 :doc:`delegation`），并在以下三种情形下被选用于某一轮对话："

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:28
msgid ""
"the peer is not on the ``trust`` list and ``auto_reply.untrusted`` is "
"``sandbox``;"
msgstr "对端不在 ``trust`` 名单中，且 ``auto_reply.untrusted`` 为 ``sandbox``；"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:30
msgid ""
"the peer is admitted by ``inbound.admit`` and ``auto_reply.admitted`` is "
"``sandbox`` (since 0.3.9);"
msgstr ""
"对端由 ``inbound.admit`` 准入，且 ``auto_reply.admitted`` 为 ``sandbox``\\ （自 "
"0.3.9 起）；"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:32
msgid ""
"the peer is on the ``trust`` list and ``auto_reply.trusted`` is "
"``sandbox``."
msgstr "对端在 ``trust`` 名单中，且 ``auto_reply.trusted`` 为 ``sandbox``\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:34
msgid ""
"A turn that is selected for the sandbox never runs outside it. If the "
"sandbox is unavailable, the node does not start the agent. The sandbox is"
" absent from the ``openai`` backend because that backend starts no "
"program, but its turns for untrusted peers count against the run budget."
msgstr ""
"被选用沙箱的一轮对话绝不会在沙箱之外运行。沙箱不可用时，节点不会启动 Agent。\\ ``openai`` "
"后端不使用沙箱，因为该后端不启动任何程序，但它针对未受信任对端的对话仍计入运行预算。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:40
msgid "Supported platforms"
msgstr "支持的平台"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:42
msgid "Linux"
msgstr "Linux"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:43
msgid ""
"The sandbox uses ``bubblewrap`` with a seccomp filter. It needs the "
"``bubblewrap`` package. The supported hosts are Debian 12 (bubblewrap "
"0.8) and Ubuntu 24.04 with the AppArmor profile described below. On "
"Ubuntu 24.04 and later, the default AppArmor policy prevents "
"``bubblewrap`` from creating user namespaces, and the node reports "
"``userns_blocked`` with the command that installs a narrow profile."
msgstr ""
"沙箱使用带 seccomp 过滤器的 ``bubblewrap``，需要 ``bubblewrap`` 软件包。支持的主机为 Debian "
"12（bubblewrap 0.8）和装有下述 AppArmor profile 的 Ubuntu 24.04。在 Ubuntu 24.04 "
"及更高版本上，默认的 AppArmor 策略会阻止 ``bubblewrap`` 创建用户命名空间，节点会报告 "
"``userns_blocked``，并给出安装窄范围 profile 的命令。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:50
msgid "macOS"
msgstr "macOS"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:51
msgid ""
"The sandbox uses Seatbelt through ``/usr/bin/sandbox-exec``. Before a "
"turn starts, the node runs a self-check inside the profile. A host on "
"which the self-check fails reports the sandbox as unavailable (the reason"
" of the failed item) and turns away the turns that need it with "
"``sandbox_unavailable``. The node never runs such a turn without the "
"sandbox. The sandbox is available from version 0.3.1 and is verified on "
"macOS 14 and macOS 15; version 0.3.0 does not include it "
"(``platform_unsupported.pending``). The profile denies everything by "
"default and opens the system libraries and tools, the run directory, the "
"work directory and the egress endpoint of the run."
msgstr ""
"沙箱通过 ``/usr/bin/sandbox-exec`` 使用 Seatbelt。每个回合开始前，节点会在 profile "
"内运行一次自检。自检失败的主机会把沙箱报告为不可用（失败项的原因），并以 ``sandbox_unavailable`` "
"拒绝需要沙箱的回合。节点从不在没有沙箱的情况下运行这样的回合。该沙箱自 0.3.1 版起可用，并已在 macOS 14 与 macOS 15 "
"上验证；0.3.0 版不含此沙箱（``platform_unsupported.pending``）。profile "
"默认拒绝一切，只开放系统库与工具、运行目录、工作目录以及本次运行的出口端点。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:61
msgid "Windows and other platforms"
msgstr "Windows 及其他平台"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:62
msgid ""
"There is no sandbox. Every turn that is selected for the sandbox is "
"refused with ``platform_unsupported``: the turns for peers that are not "
"trusted when ``auto_reply.untrusted`` is ``sandbox``, and every turn when"
" ``auto_reply.trusted`` is ``sandbox``. The node never runs such a turn "
"without the sandbox. With ``auto_reply.trusted`` set to ``direct``, the "
"agent runs for trusted peers as the user of the node, as on Linux and "
"macOS."
msgstr ""
"没有沙箱。所有被选定在沙箱中运行的轮次都会以 ``platform_unsupported`` 拒绝：\\ "
"``auto_reply.untrusted`` 为 ``sandbox`` 时未受信任对端的轮次，以及 "
"``auto_reply.trusted`` 为 ``sandbox`` "
"时的所有轮次。节点从不在沙箱之外运行此类轮次。``auto_reply.trusted`` 设为 ``direct`` 时，Agent "
"以节点用户的身份为受信任对端运行，与 Linux 和 macOS 相同。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:70
msgid "The AppArmor profile"
msgstr "AppArmor profile"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:72
msgid ""
"``anet doctor --apparmor-profile`` prints the profile on standard output "
"and writes no file. The sentence ``userns_blocked`` names the command "
"that installs it:"
msgstr ""
"``anet doctor --apparmor-profile`` 把 profile 打印到标准输出，不写任何文件。句子 "
"``userns_blocked`` 给出安装它的命令："

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:80
msgid ""
"The profile has two parts. The profile ``anet-bwrap`` is attached to "
"``/usr/bin/bwrap`` and gives ``bubblewrap`` the permission to create user"
" namespaces. Everything that ``bubblewrap`` starts, the sandboxed agent "
"included, runs under the stacked profile ``anet-bwrap//&anet-bwrap-"
"unpriv``, which holds no capability. The structure is that of the profile"
" ``bwrap-userns-restrict`` which Ubuntu ships from release 24.10, and the"
" profile changes no ``sysctl`` setting. The profile can be removed with "
"``apparmor_parser -R`` and by deleting the file."
msgstr ""
"该 profile 分为两部分。profile ``anet-bwrap`` 附加在 ``/usr/bin/bwrap`` 上，授予 "
"``bubblewrap`` 创建用户命名空间的权限。``bubblewrap`` 启动的一切，包括沙箱中的 agent，都在叠加的 "
"profile ``anet-bwrap//&anet-bwrap-unpriv`` 下运行，后者不持有任何 capability。其结构与 "
"Ubuntu 自 24.10 起提供的 profile ``bwrap-userns-restrict`` 相同，且不更改任何 "
"``sysctl`` 设置。可以用 ``apparmor_parser -R`` 并删除该文件来移除这个 profile。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:89
msgid "What the sandbox restricts"
msgstr "沙箱的限制范围"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:91
msgid ""
"On Linux the node starts each run in new namespaces for users, processes,"
" IPC, host names, control groups and the network. The run has these "
"properties."
msgstr "在 Linux 上，节点在新的用户、进程、IPC、主机名、控制组和网络命名空间中启动每次运行。运行具有以下性质。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:94
msgid "No network"
msgstr "无网络"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:95
msgid ""
"The run has no network interface other than its own loopback. It cannot "
"connect to the machine, to the local network or to the Internet. The only"
" way out is a local endpoint that the node provides for the run (see "
"`Model access`_ and `Allowed hosts`_)."
msgstr ""
"运行除自身的回环接口外没有其他网络接口，无法连接本机、本地网络或互联网。唯一的出口是节点为该次运行提供的本地端点（参见 `模型访问`_ 与 "
"`允许的主机`_）。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:100
msgid "Own file system"
msgstr "独立的文件系统"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:101
msgid ""
"The run sees the system directories read-only. Its home directory and its"
" temporary directories are created for the run and deleted when the run "
"ends. Its working directory is separate from the working directory of "
"runs that are not sandboxed, and the data directory of the node, the "
"control token, the local socket directories and the sockets of other "
"modules are never visible. Runs that are not sandboxed work under "
"``<cache>/anet/work/<aid>/<interaction>/`` (or in "
"``auto_reply.work_dir``), and sandboxed runs under ``<cache>/anet/work-"
"sandbox/<aid>/<interaction>/``. The two roots never overlap, so that "
"nothing that the run of an untrusted peer left behind is in the directory"
" where an agent without a sandbox starts. The work directories are "
"removed within the retention period in every build."
msgstr ""
"运行可以只读地看到系统目录。其主目录和临时目录为该次运行创建，运行结束时删除。其工作目录与未沙箱化的运行的工作目录分开，节点的数据目录、控制令牌、本地套接字目录和其他模块的套接字始终不可见。未沙箱化的运行在"
" ``<cache>/anet/work/<aid>/<interaction>/``\\ （或 "
"``auto_reply.work_dir``）下工作，沙箱化的运行在 ``<cache>/anet/work-"
"sandbox/<aid>/<interaction>/`` "
"下工作。两个根目录从不重叠，这样不受信任的对端的运行所留下的任何东西，都不会出现在无沙箱的 agent "
"启动的目录里。工作目录在每个构建中都会在保存期内被删除。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:113
msgid "No privileges"
msgstr "无特权"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:114
msgid ""
"All Linux capabilities are dropped. A seccomp filter denies system calls "
"that create user namespaces, mount file systems, trace other processes, "
"load kernel modules, use ``io_uring``, ``bpf`` or the kernel key store, "
"and it rejects other system-call interfaces. The run ends when the node "
"ends."
msgstr ""
"所有 Linux capability 均被丢弃。seccomp 过滤器拒绝创建用户命名空间、挂载文件系统、跟踪其他进程、加载内核模块、使用 "
"``io_uring``\\ 、\\ ``bpf`` 或内核密钥存储的系统调用，并拒绝其他系统调用接口。节点结束时，运行随之结束。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:119
msgid "Clean environment"
msgstr "干净的环境"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:120
msgid ""
"The environment is built from an empty set. It contains the locale, the "
"terminal type, a reduced ``PATH`` and the variables that point the agent "
"to the node's endpoint. It contains no key of the operator and no proxy "
"setting of the daemon."
msgstr "环境从空集构建，包含区域设置、终端类型、精简的 ``PATH``，以及指向节点端点的变量。其中没有运营人员的任何密钥，也没有守护进程的代理设置。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:125
msgid "Resource limits"
msgstr "资源限制"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:126
msgid ""
"When user-level systemd is available, a run is limited to 2 GiB of memory"
" and 256 tasks, and ``anet status`` reports the limits as ``full``. "
"Without it, the other limits still apply and the node reports the warning"
" ``no_cgroup_limits``. The wall-clock time of a run is bounded by "
"``api_timeout_seconds`` (180 seconds by default). A run whose directories"
" grow past 2 GiB is stopped."
msgstr ""
"用户级 systemd 可用时，一次运行被限制为 2 GiB 内存和 256 个任务，``anet status`` 将这些限制报告为 "
"``full``\\ 。不可用时，其余限制仍然适用，节点报告警告 ``no_cgroup_limits``\\ 。一次运行的挂钟时间以 "
"``api_timeout_seconds`` 为上限（默认 180 秒）。目录增长超过 2 GiB 的运行会被停止。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:133
msgid ""
"The node checks the sandbox before it relies on it. It starts a probe in "
"the same sandbox that asserts five properties: the loopback interface "
"works; a connection to a port on the host fails; a connection to an "
"abstract socket of the host fails; the system call for the kernel key "
"store is denied; and the creation of a new user namespace is denied. If "
"one assertion does not hold, the node reports the sandbox as unavailable."
" The result is cached for five minutes."
msgstr "节点在依赖沙箱之前先检查它。它在同一沙箱中启动一个探测程序，断言五项性质：回环接口可用；连接主机上的某个端口失败；连接主机的抽象套接字失败；内核密钥存储的系统调用被拒绝；创建新的用户命名空间被拒绝。任何一项断言不成立，节点即报告沙箱不可用。结果缓存五分钟。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:140
msgid "The commands to check a node are:"
msgstr "检查节点的命令如下："

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:148
msgid "Model access"
msgstr "模型访问"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:150
msgid ""
"An agent in the sandbox cannot reach a model service directly, and the "
"node does not give it a key. The node gives the agent an address on its "
"own loopback interface. Requests to that address are handled by the node,"
" which calls the model service itself and adds the key of the operator. "
"The agent receives only a placeholder."
msgstr ""
"沙箱中的 Agent 无法直接访问模型服务，节点也不向其提供密钥。节点给 Agent "
"一个位于自身回环接口上的地址。对该地址的请求由节点处理，节点自行调用模型服务并加上运营人员的密钥。Agent 收到的只是占位值。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:156
msgid "The node applies the following rules to every request on this route."
msgstr "节点对这条路径上的每个请求应用以下规则。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:158
msgid ""
"The model is fixed. The ``model`` field of every request is rewritten to "
"the model that the operator configured, or to the cheapest model of the "
"upstream when none is configured. A model alias such as ``sonnet`` is "
"mapped to its identifier."
msgstr ""
"模型固定。每个请求的 ``model`` 字段被改写为运营人员配置的模型；未配置时，改写为上游最便宜的模型。\\ ``sonnet`` "
"之类的模型别名会映射为其标识。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:162
msgid ""
"The output length is bounded. ``max_tokens`` and the equivalent fields "
"are at most 8192, and are set to 8192 when absent."
msgstr "输出长度有界。\\ ``max_tokens`` 及等效字段最大为 8192，缺失时设为 8192。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:164
msgid ""
"Tools of the model service that run on the service side, such as web "
"search, web fetch and code execution, are refused. They would let a "
"request leave the sandbox through the service."
msgstr "在服务端运行的模型服务工具，例如网络搜索、网页抓取和代码执行，会被拒绝。否则请求可以经由该服务离开沙箱。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:167
msgid ""
"Connectors to remote tool servers (``mcp_servers``) and container fields "
"are refused. Media must be included in the request; a reference to a URL "
"is refused."
msgstr "连接远程工具服务器的连接器（``mcp_servers``）和容器字段会被拒绝。媒体必须包含在请求之内，对 URL 的引用会被拒绝。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:170
msgid "Requests to the OpenAI interface are sent with ``store: false``."
msgstr "发往 OpenAI 接口的请求带有 ``store: false``\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:171
msgid ""
"Credentials and routing headers that the agent adds are removed before "
"the key is added. Beta feature headers are reduced to a fixed list."
msgstr "Agent 添加的凭据和路由标头在加入密钥之前被移除。Beta 功能标头被缩减为固定的列表。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:173
msgid "A request body must be an uncompressed JSON object."
msgstr "请求体必须是未压缩的 JSON 对象。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:175
msgid ""
"A request that violates a rule receives an error whose text begins with "
"``anet:`` and explains the rule, so that the agent can answer the task "
"without the forbidden operation. The sentences are listed in :ref"
":`reference-reason-codes`."
msgstr ""
"违反规则的请求会收到以 ``anet:`` 开头的错误，其文本说明所违反的规则，使 Agent 能够不进行被禁止的操作而回答任务。这些说明语句列于"
" :ref:`reference-reason-codes`\\ 。"

