msgstr "``api_base`` 所指明的服务，必须设置。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:194
msgid "``cursor``"
msgstr "``cursor``"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:195
msgid ""
"Not supported in the sandbox, because the agent cannot send its model "
"requests through the node. The node reports ``agent_unsupported``."
msgstr "沙箱中不支持，因为该 Agent 无法将其模型请求经由节点发送。节点报告 ``agent_unsupported``\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:198
msgid "The node uses the system certificate store to verify the model service."
msgstr "节点使用系统证书库验证模型服务。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:201
msgid "Limits of one run"
msgstr "单次运行的限制"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:203
msgid "Each run has fixed limits on what it can do through its endpoint."
msgstr "每次运行通过其端点所能做的事情有固定的限制。"

