#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:227
msgid "Allowed hosts"
msgstr "允许的主机"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:229
msgid ""
"Some tasks need a package index or a document server. The operator can "
"allow specific hosts with ``anet autoreply set --egress-allow``. The list"
" is empty by default."
msgstr ""
"有些任务需要软件包索引或文档服务器。运营人员可以用 ``anet autoreply set --egress-allow`` "
"允许特定主机。该列表默认为空。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:238
msgid ""
"Adding a host asks for confirmation on a terminal. Removing hosts, "
"including removing all of them with an empty value, does not."
msgstr "添加主机需要在终端上确认。移除主机，包括用空值移除全部主机，则无需确认。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:241
msgid "The node enforces the list as follows."
msgstr "节点按以下方式强制执行该列表。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:243
msgid ""
"Each entry is one complete host name in lower case, such as ``pypi.org``."
" A wildcard, an IP address, a port, ``localhost`` and a name that ends in"
" ``.local``, ``.internal``, ``.lan`` or ``.home.arpa`` are refused. The "
"list holds at most 64 entries."
msgstr ""
"每个条目是一个完整的小写主机名，例如 ``pypi.org``\\ 。通配符、IP 地址、端口、\\ ``localhost``，以及以 "
"``.local``\\ 、\\ ``.internal``\\ 、\\ ``.lan`` 或 ``.home.arpa`` "
"结尾的名称均被拒绝。列表最多包含 64 个条目。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:247
msgid ""
"An entry must not be a host of a model service, including the host of "
"``api_base``. The agent already reaches the model through the node."
msgstr "条目不得是模型服务的主机，包括 ``api_base`` 的主机。Agent 已经能通过节点访问模型。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:249
msgid ""
"Only connections to port 443 are possible, and only through the "
"``CONNECT`` method. The node compares the requested name with the entries"
" exactly. It does not accept suffixes."
msgstr "只能连接 443 端口，且只能通过 ``CONNECT`` 方法。节点将所请求的名称与条目逐一精确比较，不接受后缀。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:252
msgid ""
"The node resolves the name itself. If any address of the name is private,"
" reserved or on the machine, the request is refused. The node connects "
"only to an address that it has verified."
msgstr "节点自行解析名称。如果名称的任何一个地址属于私有地址、保留地址或本机地址，请求即被拒绝。节点只连接经过其验证的地址。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:255
msgid ""
"After the tunnel opens, the node reads the first TLS message of the "
"agent. The name in it must equal the requested name, and the message must"
" not request encrypted client hello. Otherwise the node closes the "
"tunnel."
msgstr ""
"隧道打开后，节点读取 Agent 的第一条 TLS 消息。其中的名称必须与所请求的名称相同，且该消息不得请求加密的 client "
"hello。否则节点关闭隧道。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:258
msgid ""
"The node never connects through a proxy, even when the daemon's "
"environment names one."
msgstr "节点从不通过代理连接，即使守护进程的环境指明了代理。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:261
msgid ""
"Every allowed host is a way for the data of a task to leave the machine. "
"The node checks the host name and the first TLS message. It does not "
"decrypt the traffic and does not inspect what is sent. A request that "
"names an allowed host in the TLS message and a different one inside the "
"encrypted connection, known as domain fronting, is not detected. Allow "
"only hosts that the operator would also allow a person to send data to."
msgstr ""
"每个被允许的主机，都是任务数据离开本机的一条途径。节点检查主机名和第一条 TLS 消息，但不解密流量，也不检查发送的内容。在 TLS "
"消息中指明一个被允许的主机、而在加密连接内部指向另一个主机的请求，即所谓域前置（domain "
"fronting），不会被检测到。只应允许运营人员同样允许人向其发送数据的主机。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:269
msgid "Run budget"
msgstr "运行预算"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:271
msgid ""
"Every turn for an untrusted peer costs the operator money for the model "
"and machine time. The node counts these turns for each local calendar "
"day. A turn counts when the ``exec`` backend runs an agent in the sandbox"
" and when the ``openai`` backend answers. Sandboxed turns for peers that "
"``inbound.admit`` admits count in the same budget. Turns for trusted "
"peers are not counted, nor are direct runs for admitted peers, and "
"neither is ``anet autoreply test``."
msgstr ""
"针对未受信任对端的每一轮对话，都会让运营人员付出模型费用和机器时间。节点按本地日历日统计这些轮次。``exec`` 后端在沙箱中运行 Agent "
"时，以及 ``openai`` 后端作答时，均计入一轮。``inbound.admit`` "
"准入的对端在沙箱中运行的轮次计入同一预算。针对受信任对端的轮次不计入，已准入对端的直接运行不计入，``anet autoreply test`` "
"也不计入。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:282
msgid "Key"
msgstr "配置键"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:283
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:284
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:285
msgid "``auto_reply.sandbox.runs_per_day``"
msgstr "``auto_reply.sandbox.runs_per_day``"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:286
msgid "20"
msgstr "20"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:287
msgid "Runs for all untrusted peers in one day."
msgstr "一天内针对所有未受信任对端的运行次数。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:288
msgid "``auto_reply.sandbox.runs_per_peer_per_day``"
msgstr "``auto_reply.sandbox.runs_per_peer_per_day``"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:289
msgid "5"
msgstr "5"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:290
msgid "Runs for one peer in one day."
msgstr "一天内针对单个对端的运行次数。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:292
msgid ""
"A value of 0 means that the node runs nothing for untrusted peers. The "
"task stays in the inbox, and the requester receives no refusal. When the "
"budget of the day is used up, the node does not start the agent, and the "
"requester receives ``budget`` with the time at which the day ends. The "
"counts are rebuilt from the evidence chain when the daemon starts, so a "
"restart does not reset them."
msgstr ""
"取值为 0 表示节点不为未受信任的对端运行任何内容。任务保留在收件箱中，请求方不会收到拒绝。当日预算用完时，节点不启动 Agent，请求方收到 "
"``budget`` 以及当日结束的时间。计数在守护进程启动时依据证据链重建，因此重启不会将其重置。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:298
msgid ""
"At most two runs for untrusted peers are active at once, and at most one "
"for each peer. A turn that finds no free place is taken at the next scan,"
" which is every five seconds, and is not counted as a refusal."
msgstr "针对未受信任对端同时活动的运行最多两个，每个对端最多一个。找不到空位的一轮对话在下一次扫描（每五秒一次）时处理，不计作拒绝。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:303
msgid "Failure and diagnostics"
msgstr "故障与诊断"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:305
msgid ""
"The sandbox fails closed. The requester of a task that could not run "
"receives one of the following codes in the refusal."
msgstr "沙箱以封闭方式失败。未能运行的任务，其请求方会在拒绝中收到下列代码之一。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:308
msgid "``sandbox_unavailable``"
msgstr "``sandbox_unavailable``"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:309
msgid ""
"The provider's sandbox cannot run the task now. The requester can send it"
" again later."
msgstr "提供方的沙箱目前无法运行该任务。请求方可以稍后重新发送。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:312
msgid "``budget``"
msgstr "``budget``"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:313
msgid "The provider has used up the day's runs for untrusted peers."
msgstr "提供方已用完当日针对未受信任对端的运行次数。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:315
msgid "The operator sees the cause in ``anet status`` and ``anet doctor``:"
msgstr "运营人员可在 ``anet status`` 和 ``anet doctor`` 中看到原因："

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:321
msgid "Code"
msgstr "代码"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:322
msgid "Cause"
msgstr "原因"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:323
msgid "``no_bwrap``"
msgstr "``no_bwrap``"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:324
msgid "``bubblewrap`` is not installed."
msgstr "未安装 ``bubblewrap``\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:325
msgid "``userns_blocked``"
msgstr "``userns_blocked``"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:326
msgid ""
"The AppArmor policy of Ubuntu prevents user namespaces. The sentence "
"contains the command that installs a profile."
msgstr "Ubuntu 的 AppArmor 策略阻止了用户命名空间。说明语句包含安装配置文件的命令。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:328
msgid "``userns_unavailable``"
msgstr "``userns_unavailable``"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:329
msgid "The kernel or the container does not allow user namespaces."
msgstr "内核或容器不允许用户命名空间。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:330
msgid "``sandbox_start_failed``"
msgstr "``sandbox_start_failed``"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:331
msgid ""
"``bubblewrap`` could not set up the sandbox. The sentence carries the "
"message of ``bubblewrap`` when there is one. Run ``anet doctor --json`` "
"and report the result, or set ``untrusted`` to ``off``."
msgstr ""
"``bubblewrap`` 没能建立沙箱。有 ``bubblewrap`` 的消息时，句子会带上它。请运行 ``anet doctor "
"--json`` 并报告结果，或把 ``untrusted`` 设为 ``off``。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:334
msgid "``netns_failed``"
msgstr "``netns_failed``"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:335
msgid "The network isolation check failed."
msgstr "网络隔离检查失败。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:336
msgid "``seccomp_failed``"
msgstr "``seccomp_failed``"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:337
msgid "The system-call filter check failed."
msgstr "系统调用过滤器检查失败。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:338
msgid "``agent_unsupported``"
msgstr "``agent_unsupported``"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:339
msgid "The agent cannot run in the sandbox."
msgstr "该 Agent 无法在沙箱中运行。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:340
msgid "``no_api_key``, ``no_api_base``, ``no_model``"
msgstr "``no_api_key``\\ 、\\ ``no_api_base``\\ 、\\ ``no_model``"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:341
msgid "The configuration lacks a key, a service address or a model."
msgstr "配置缺少密钥、服务地址或模型。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:342
msgid "``no_cgroup_limits``"
msgstr "``no_cgroup_limits``"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:343
msgid "Warning: memory and task limits are not available."
msgstr "警告：内存和任务数限制不可用。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:346
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "说明"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:348
msgid ""
"An agent that the operator marks as trusted runs as the operator's user, "
"with the rights of that user. The default ``direct`` mode is a statement "
"of trust. ``trusted = sandbox`` applies the sandbox to trusted peers as "
"well."
msgstr ""
"运营人员标记为受信任的 Agent，以运营人员的用户身份运行，拥有该用户的权限。默认的 ``direct`` 模式本身就是一种信任声明。\\ "
"``trusted = sandbox`` 则将沙箱同样应用于受信任的对端。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:351
msgid ""
"The key of the model service stays on the node. A task cannot read it, "
"but a task can make the node use it: the budget and the limits of a run "
"bound that use."
msgstr "模型服务的密钥保留在节点上。任务无法读取它，但任务可以促使节点使用它：运行的预算和限制约束了这种使用。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:354
msgid ""
"The sandbox does not inspect what an agent writes to its reply. The reply"
" reaches the requester as written."
msgstr "沙箱不检查 Agent 写入回复的内容。回复按所写内容到达请求方。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:356
msgid ""
"A turn that is interrupted by a crash is not counted, so the daily count "
"can be lower than the number of runs."
msgstr "因崩溃而中断的一轮对话不计入，因此每日计数可能低于实际运行次数。"

#: ../../topics/sandbox.rst:358
msgid ""
"The control token and the local socket paths are never visible to a "
"sandboxed run. Do not copy them into the working directory of a run."
msgstr "控制令牌和本地套接字路径对沙箱中的运行始终不可见。请勿将它们复制到运行的工作目录中。"

